5UFJ6bUtZYU15NHdBMGxQT1c3NTlnclpVbnFhbno4NkZFYXV3aGxsOUJQNnBzNi1ONlliRVVFVUtaQ05mclBPeDhyMlFDay1fYnRPZDZuVUdLUXhod2M3REc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Host Hotels 透過布魯克林收購增加了紐約市的足跡"},{"title":"Host Hotels & Resorts Q3 Earnings Call Highlights","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNSFdPaVJYU0RCZGNLOXY0VVFyN2ZESE1XMy1mQWRVNWlqWFJDdWl1dlh1RDFZdGRpT1lac3p4eWVsVDlBRlQyVmkyVGJ3MlN0Zmo3UWdydGJBQ0VqUklwaDJ3WXVWLW96RkZZSlY5N2dfOHgwSzA4Tlg3SkNnaTRZNWdSSlcyc1NKenVCbVRheWR2dU1ncTZ0NEFFY3lIWk1ub0gwOW1IdVlVdGMx?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Host Hotels & Resorts 第三季財報電話會議亮點"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1070750/000107075026000054/hst-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are the largest publicly traded lodging REIT, with a geographically diverse portfolio of luxury and upper-upscale hotels. As of February 20, 2026, our consolidated lodging portfolio consists of 76 primarily luxury and upper-upscale hotels containing approximately 41,700 rooms, with substantially all located in the United States (five of the hotels are located outside of the U.S. in Brazil and Canada). In addition, we own non-controlling interests in seven domestic joint ventures that focus on the lodging industry, see \" - Other Real Estate Interests\" for a further description.","zh":null},{"en":"Host Inc. was incorporated as a Maryland corporation in 1998 and operates as a self-managed and self-administered REIT. Host Inc. owns hotels and conducts operations through Host L.P., of which Host Inc. is the sole general partner and of which it holds approximately 99% of the partnership interests (\"OP units\") as of December 31, 2025. The remaining partnership interests are owned by various unaffiliated limited partners. Host Inc. has the exclusive and complete responsibility for Host L.P.'s day-to-day management and control.","zh":null},{"en":"Our goal is to be the preeminent owner of high-quality lodging real estate in growing markets in the U.S. and to generate superior long-term risk adjusted returns for our stockholders throughout all phases of the lodging cycle through a combination of appreciation in asset values, growth in earnings and the payment of dividends. The pillars of our strategy to achieve this objective and elevate our growth profile include:","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The lodging industry is highly competitive. Competition often is specific to individual markets and is based on several factors, including location, brand, guest facilities and amenities, level of service, room rates and the quality of accommodations. The lodging industry is viewed as consisting of six different categories, each of which caters to a discrete set of customer tastes and needs: luxury, upper upscale, upscale, upper midscale, midscale and economy. The classification of a hotel is based on lodging industry standards, which take into consideration many factors, such as guest facilities and amenities, level of service and quality of accommodations. Most of our hotels operate in urban and resort markets either as luxury properties under such brand names as 1 Hotels , Alila , Andaz , Fairmont , Grand Hyatt , JW Marriott , Ritz-Carlton , The Don Cesar , The Luxury Collection and W","zh":null},{"en":"We also compete with other REITs and other public and private investors for the acquisition of new properties and investment opportunities as we attempt to position our portfolio to best take advantage of changes in markets and travel patterns of our customers.","zh":null}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Hotel","val":6015000000,"zh":"Hotel"},{"name":"Occupancy","val":3608000000,"zh":"Occupancy"},{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":1803000000,"zh":"Food & Beverage"},{"name":"Hotel Other","val":604000000,"zh":"Hotel Other"},{"name":"Home Building","val":99000000,"zh":"Home Building"}],"total":6114000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6010000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CA","val":76000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"BR","val":28000000,"zh":"BR"}],"total":6114000000}},"peers":[]}}